# Local environment and credential files must never enter the build context.
**/.env*
**/*.env
**/.npmrc
**/.netrc
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*credentials*.json
**/secrets
**/.aws
**/.ssh
**/.docker

# Dependencies, generated output, and archives.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/build
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/*.[zZ][iI][pP]
next-env.d.ts

# Repository history and local tooling.
**/.git
.github
.vercel
.vscode
.idea
.codex
.agents
.DS_Store
Dockerfile*
.dockerignore
